<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian plane hijack ends peacefully.</title>
<headline>Austrian plane hijack ends peacefully.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Austrian Airlines plane was hijacked on Tuesday and landed in Berlin but the drama was quickly over and nobody was harmed, an Austrian Airlines spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>&quot;It has ended peacefully. No one has been harmed,&quot; the spokeswoman told Reuters.  </p>
<p>An unidentified hijacker had been overpowered at Berlin's Tegel airport, the spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The plane, carrying 28 passengers and five crew, had taken off from the airport for Vienna only to be forced to turn back shortly afterwards, the spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>She gave no further details but said the Austrian flag carrier was preparing a statement.</p>
</text>
